        "TileImage": "$($repository 2f4d628b-c70a-4218-935d-63cbbadf3356).Image",
        "Description": "47, a new contract has just hit the second you, two guards inside the Ark Society are working together subliminally affect the minds of the global elite. Seeking to invoke some petition amongst them to make Free WiFi at libraries illegal. If my intel is correct, even YOU can&apos;t help yourself with Free WiFi from time to time. Now imagine a world where that&apos;s gone 47. Yeah, it fucking sucks. Eliminate the targets. With haste I should add. Optional target eliminations are preferred, but not required",
